<title>JAPAN: Nissho Electronics - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nissho Electronics - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 22.44		vs	   18.24</p>
<p> Operating	  944    million	  vs	  903    million</p>
<p> Current		1.02		vs	  923    million</p>
<p> Net		  404    million	  vs	  376    million</p>
<p> EPS		   23.60 yen	  vs	   22.46 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     17 million	  vs	  17 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.50 yen	  vs	    7.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nissho Electronics Corp is a trading firm specialising in electronic products.</p>
</text>
